<title>JAPAN: Daishinku to issue 100 mln Sfr warrant.</title>
<headline>Daishinku to issue 100 mln Sfr warrant.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Daishinku Corp</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Swiss Bank Corp</p>
<p>JOINT LEAD - Daiwa Securities Bank Switzerland</p>
<p>GUARANTOR - Tokyo-Mitsubishi Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE warrant	   ISSUE NO		AMT   100 million Sfr</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 31.Oct.00</p>
<p> EXER PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> EXER FROM 14.Nov.96  EXER TO 17.Oct.00</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 31.Oct.96  INT PAY 31.Oct</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE 22.Oct.96 SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The conversion price and currency rate will be decided on October 18 and the coupon on October 22.</p>
</text>
